#: 75765772134387712
msgid "DialogueIntroCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"So, mare, do you smell it? Gold! It's somewhere nearby… And love… in that "
"rock over there!"

#: 75765971959418880
msgid "DialogueIntroHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr!"

#: 75766215002558464
msgid "DialogueIntroCharacter2"
msgstr ""
"What do you mean, 'if I hear a woman there again, you'll throw me off'? "
"Someone was definitely lonely there."

#: 75766376147718144
msgid "DialogueIntroHorse2"
msgstr "Neeigh! Grr-ha!"

#: 75766594431881216
msgid "DialogueIntroCharacter3"
msgstr "Alright, alright! It was just an echo… of my greatness!"

#: 75766733204623360
msgid "DialogueMineFoundCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"A rock! Divine! Like Aphrodite's thigh! Something is definitely gleaming in "
"there, my liver just trembled!"

#: 75766977115983872
msgid "DialogueMineFoundHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr! Pffuuu.."

#: 75767084016209920
msgid "DialogueMineFoundCharacter2"
msgstr "Well, sorry that my body reacts to beauty!"

#: 75768133359767552
msgid "DialogueTimeIsUpHorse1"
msgstr "Neigh!"

#: 75768214897037312
msgid "DialogueTimeIsUpCharacter1"
msgstr "What? Sunset already?"

#: 75768748328620032
msgid "DialogueTimeIsUpHorse2"
msgstr "Hh-hh! Eeee-ih!"

#: 75769024796168192
msgid "DialogueTimeIsUpCharacter2"
msgstr ""
"Mosquitoes… Them again! Yes-yes, I remember you're the green little house, "
"I'm coming! Just don't run away!"

#: 75769959874301952
msgid "DialoguePickLootIntroTrader1"
msgstr "Hey! Too much loot. The horse's bag can't fit it all."

#: 75770225956753408
msgid "DialoguePickLootIntroTrader2"
msgstr "Pick the best of what you can carry to the storage."

#: 76060126094823424
msgid "DialoguePrepareToOpenCraftCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"Now… Now I shall create a masterpiece! A piece of jewelry that will make Her "
"regret!"

#: 76060331171123200
msgid "DialoguePrepareToOpenCraftHorse1"
msgstr "Brrr-r-r."

#: 76061423992836096
msgid "DialoguerAfterCraftCharacter1"
msgstr "LOOK, HORSE! It shines like my eyes before I met my ex!"

#: 76061521736896512
msgid "DialoguerAfterCraftHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr!"

#: 76061738473361408
msgid "DialoguerAfterCraftCharacter2"
msgstr "This… this is the divine light of my revenge!"

#: 76061830932598784
msgid "DialoguerAfterCraftHorse2"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr! Brrr..."

#: 76061898951626752
msgid "DialoguerAfterCraftCharacter3"
msgstr ""
"You're just jealous — you don't have fingers to wear such magnificence. All "
"that's left is to find a buyer with fingers!"

#: 76062368449433600
msgid "DialoguerAfterTradeBuyer1"
msgstr "You made this yourself? Beautiful, I'll take it."

#: 76062530391511040
msgid "DialoguerAfterTradeCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"He… he understood! Inside the jewelry — is me. Inside me — gold. Inside the "
"gold — a god."

#: 76062825645346816
msgid "DialoguerAfterTradeHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr! Neeigh!"

#: 76062978284457984
msgid "DialoguerAfterTradeCharacter2"
msgstr "You're right, horse. They're not ready for the truth…"

#: 76063254827503616
msgid "DialogueBeforeUpgradeHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr!"

#: 76063498000666624
msgid "DialogueBeforeUpgradeCharacter1"
msgstr "Money? Me? Do you know what will happen if She finds out I'm rich?"

#: 76063745632374784
msgid "DialogueBeforeUpgradeHorse2"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 76063937093963776
msgid "DialogueBeforeUpgradeCharacter2"
msgstr "Fine, I'll invest in myself — but only so you stop nagging me!"

#: 76064239725580288
msgid "DialogueAfterUpgradeCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"I became faster, stronger and cheaper to produce! She would have liked it."

#: 76064347783434240
msgid "DialogueAfterUpgradeHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 76064479283253248
msgid "DialogueAfterUpgradeCharacter2"
msgstr ""
"Well, there was no need to insist! You have your own fetishes — hooves and "
"oats."

#: 76065879857827840
msgid "DialogueLobbyLikesCharacter1"
msgstr "See, mare? They love me!"

#: 76066013412855808
msgid "DialogueLobbyLikesHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr! Pffuuu.."

#: 76066107042304000
msgid "DialogueLobbyLikesCharacter2"
msgstr "You're right! This is just the beginning! Soon they'll all be my fans…"

#: 76344321220284416
msgid "character"
msgstr "Character"

#: 76344471367979008
msgid "horse"
msgstr "Horse"

#: 76344680219152384
msgid "trader"
msgstr "Trader"

#: 76344756748423168
msgid "buyer"
msgstr "Buyer"

#: 131220345145528320
msgid "terrainDispenserFound"
msgstr "Wow! Prey!"

#: 131220694531051520
msgid "terrainDispenserCollecting"
msgstr "Come on! Break it!"

#: 131220939017031680
msgid "exitDoorDescription"
msgstr "Green — is that a horse?"

#: 131221107242176512
msgid "exitDoorDescription2"
msgstr "Green? Is she… feeling sick?"

#: 137323318787444736
msgid "DialoguePickLootSelectItemsTrader1"
msgstr "Tap items to put them in the horse's bag."

#: 137351439217594368
msgid "DialoguePickLootSelectedItemsCharacter1"
msgstr "That's all that fit? The mare needs a bigger bag!"

#: 137381643633823744
msgid "DialoguePickLootClaimItemsTrader1"
msgstr "Don't worry! I'll buy the rest. I'll even throw in a little extra."

#: 137616255752605696
msgid "terrainWantMoreItems"
msgstr "I want more gold!"

#: 137629488379072512
msgid "terrainRoadIsClue"
msgstr "The trail leads to riches"

#: 138087561421918208
msgid "DialogueOrdersIntroBuyer1"
msgstr ""
"Oh, a new face! Got an order for you. Will you help replenish my collection?"

#: 138088926181330944
msgid "DialogueOrdersIntroCharacter1"
msgstr "Look, mare, they can't go a day without my help!"

#: 138089230444531712
msgid "DialogueOrdersIntroHorse1"
msgstr "Frrrr!"

#: 138089454202261504
msgid "DialogueOrdersIntroCharacter2"
msgstr "Yes, yes, without yours either."

#: 138110517984366592
msgid "DialogueOrdersThanksBuyer1"
msgstr ""
"You've helped me greatly, and I'll help you — I've marked a spot where the "
"rocks ring louder than usual."

#: 138111196928937984
msgid "DialogueOrdersThanksCharacter1"
msgstr "THEY LOVE ME SO MUCH THEY'RE WILLING TO GIVE AWAY THEIR THOUGHTS!"

#: 138111354584436736
msgid "DialogueOrdersThanksCharacter2"
msgstr "No, you can't pocket money, but knowledge — absolutely you can!"

#: 138111433626095616
msgid "DialogueOrdersThanksHorse1"
msgstr "Neigh!"

#: 139150891347611648
msgid "DialogueBeforeBirdCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"That strange fellow marked this place on the map. It's unlike anywhere we've "
"been — and I can already smell TREASURE!"

#: 139151218457186304
msgid "DialogueBeforeBirdHorse1"
msgstr "Frrr!"

#: 139151464675414016
msgid "DialogueBeforeBirdCharacter2"
msgstr ""
"A cage on my back? It's the Treasure-Hunting Canary! Now let's see where the "
"dog is buried."

#: 139160840467386368
msgid "DialogueUseBirdCharacter1"
msgstr "Now we follow the trail of feathers and the treasure is mine!"

#: 139178592703877120
msgid "DialogueAfterChestCharacter1"
msgstr "DID YOU SEE THAT, HORSE!"

#: 139178671472906240
msgid "DialogueAfterChestCharacter2"
msgstr "You'll have to haul not just me, but this chest too."

#: 139178702909214720
msgid "DialogueAfterChestHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr! Brrr..."

#: 139180374293221376
msgid "chestCollecting"
msgstr "TREASURE!"

#: 139496544913330176
msgid "DialogueClaimedChestHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 139496773167353856
msgid "DialogueClaimedChestCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"Yes, the chest is here but there's no key — but you forgot about the magic "
"forge, mare! It can do anything with anything."

#: 139512809946091520
msgid "DialogueAfterCraftChestCharacter1"
msgstr "THIS IS A JACKPOT! We must sell it quickly!"

#: 139537206085947392
msgid "DialogueAfterTradeChestCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"YES! I've been recognized. TODAY THIS SWAMP, TOMORROW THE WHOLE WORLD! "
"FORWARD, HORSE!"

#: 139537401876058112
msgid "DialogueAfterTradeChestBuyer1"
msgstr ""
"Ha-ha — seems like all the locals are wearing your shiny things. After all, "
"I'm the only one living here, Ha-ha-ha."

#: 139766416519991296
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedHorse1"
msgstr "Brrr-r-r!"

#: 139766737396830208
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedCharacter1"
msgstr "It smells… like smoke?"

#: 139767066540642304
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedHorse2"
msgstr "Hh-hh! Eeee-ih!"

#: 139767291636355072
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedCharacter2"
msgstr "Are you saying I dropped the coals on the roof of the warehouse?"

#: 139767459110719488
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedHorse3"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 139767686714626048
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainOpenedCharacter3"
msgstr "Oh… Perhaps we shouldn't go back."

#: 139772805363535872
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainStartedCharacter1"
msgstr "Different terrain. Soggy ground. Ugh, the air reeks of meaning!"

#: 139772978911252480
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainStartedHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 139773239633383424
msgid "DialogueNewTerrainStartedCharacter2"
msgstr "Alright, we grab the valuables quick and run."

#: 140259502945734656
msgid "NewTerrainDispenserCollectingCharacter1"
msgstr "What a ringing rock! As if nature itself is applauding me!"

#: 140260138097577984
msgid "DialoguePrepareToWormCharacter1"
msgstr "What was that?!"

#: 140260175347191808
msgid "DialoguePrepareToWormHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr!"

#: 140260548501835776
msgid "DialoguePrepareToWormCharacter3"
msgstr "Oh no… Was that… her?"

#: 140262190995476480
msgid "DialogueWormAppearHorse1"
msgstr "Grrr-hrr! Brrr..."

#: 140262312860979200
msgid "DialogueWormAppearCharacter1"
msgstr "Good Lord. I've woken death. Again."

#: 140263122399399936
msgid "DialoguePlayerDeathCharacter1"
msgstr "TELL HER I REGRETTED THIS!!!"

#: 140263995359891456
msgid "DialoguePlayerReviveCharacter1"
msgstr "Is this heaven? Then why does it smell so bad…"

#: 140264148288409600
msgid "DialoguePlayerReviveCharacter2"
msgstr "I see. Not dead. Even worse — alive!"

#: 140264664699506688
msgid "DialoguePlayerRevivedCharacter1"
msgstr ""
"That was close, but now I'm ready for anything! I'll try to swing the "
"pickaxe a bit quieter…"

#: 142736080803991552
msgid "tip1"
msgstr "You can push a vase. Push it twice to break it."

#: 142736223703928832
msgid "tip2"
msgstr "The Worm won’t follow you into water or swamp."

#: 142736293392289792
msgid "tip3"
msgstr "Crush bugs — they drop coins."

#: 142736344843816960
msgid "tip4"
msgstr "Some bushes hide birds that lay golden eggs."

#: 142736408026812416
msgid "tip5"
msgstr "Noise attracts dangerous enemies."

#: 142736477400600576
msgid "tip6"
msgstr "Paths lead to places of interest."

#: 142736521784725504
msgid "tip7"
msgstr "The Dealer will buy extra items from your bag."

#: 142736594941775872
msgid "tip8"
msgstr "Complete orders to unlock new locations."

#: 142736659890573312
msgid "tip9"
msgstr "Upgrade the Forge to unlock new jewelry recipes."

#: 142736729293721600
msgid "tip10"
msgstr "Remove curses at the Altar or in the Super Slot."

#: 142736813704089600
msgid "tip11"
msgstr "Items marked with “?” can be appraised by the Trader."

#: 142736907266428928
msgid "tip12"
msgstr "Upgrade your storage to hold more loot."

#: 201164984023257088
msgid "tip13"
msgstr "On pause, you can always check orders and effects."

#: 201320091704627200
msgid "tip14"
msgstr "Elite slot guarantees the best buyer."
